---
description: ISC DHCPD parsed DHCPv4 transaction -> OCSF DHCP Activity.
args:
  positional:
    - name: dhcpd
      description: The structured DHCPv4 transaction to read.
      type: field
    - name: ocsf
      description: The OCSF DHCP Activity event to build.
      type: field
---

dhcpd::ocsf::events::transaction $dhcpd, $ocsf
